// HOWDI V16.6C — AUTH + RBAC + PUBLIC-ID SECURITY AUDIT & REPAIR
// Authenticated identity helpers • role gates • ownership checks • security audit
// public_username exposure policy • internal HOWDI-ID redaction helper
// IMPORTANT: compatibility mode; legacy routes are inventoried for migration.
